  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fisheries Monitoring Control and Surveillance in Mozambique</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthen national capacity on Fisheries Monitoring Control and Surveillance (MCS) in Mozambique&#x2019;s Exclusive Economic Zone (EEZ) and coastal fisheries to complement regional and global initiatives to combat Illegal, Unreported and Unregulated (IUU) Fishing and support the implementation of Fisheries Management Plans, in the context of Co-Management.</narrative>
  </description>
